  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Special Trust Fund for Afghanistan (STFA) Joint Programme for the Northern and Southern Regions</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To provide coordinated assistance to address priority issues according to the specific needs of the most vulnerable people of Afghanistan living in the Northern and Southern Regions. Based on the four thematic windows of the ABADEI Strategy, this joint programme intends to deliver four outputs contributing to TEF?s Outcomes 2 and 3</narrative>
